## Description

GPU World: A story competition from Neal Stephenson, Gwern, and me.  The AI future is unevenly distributed. What would the world look like with AI broadly diffused, such as if we had one GPU per person?  1000-5000 words, fiction or non-fiction.  $100K in total prizes. https://t.co/qsJfQNtTGb

